{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-11_end","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-10","title":"來到墳塋","storyCode":"16-11","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-11_end.txt","sourceHash":"720b6f8c574ad60624a32d41c63f4ffbc416ff39d44a17a4254f1898ef4c62d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿米婭等人來到經歷火災後的村莊，與Raidian小隊會合。眾人商量好了如何安置村民與留下的礦工。Raidian前去詢問礦工們的想法，奇怪的情況卻發生了。Mantra發現異樣，介入調查。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"腳印就到這裡了，前面是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我認為可以不用往前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡發生了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北地區</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個村莊距離礦工們拋下車輛的地方最近，本來還想說能不能問一下情況……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看現在這樣，裡面還有沒有活人都不好說了。從柵欄被燒毀的痕跡來看，應該是不久之前才發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死……又晚了一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭繼續往前走去，直到寂靜的殘垣在視野中變得更加清晰。\n曾燃起的大火早已熄滅，周圍林中光禿的枝椏甚至無法遮蔽雙月。月光下的廢墟枯黑寂靜，所見的一切都與想像中的村莊相去甚遠。\n阿米婭記得，她曾見過類似的場景，也因此產生了瞬間的恍惚，以及擔憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士，我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶人去搜尋一下還有沒有倖存者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，我們很快就回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，極境先生。我們都過去，直接分開找找看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我好像看到那邊有人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，先生！我們是從附近過來的救援隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"您是這裡的村民嗎？請問您知不知道村子裡發生了什麽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"又來了！又來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……我應該有說我是救援隊吧？難道是我的烏薩斯語不標準嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他大概只是……害怕。我能感覺到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"但他會在這裡出現，應該就住在這附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，怎麼辦？我們要跟上去看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不要貿然跟上去了，以免再次嚇到他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不是，故意，跟著你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到，你們的衣服……和姐姐的，很像，就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衣服很像？你是說這個圖案嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的姐姐叫什麼名字呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞、塞拉菲娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這確實是Raidian的本名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"這個塞拉菲娜，是不是一位個子小小、有四隻手的黎博利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……認識她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對！我們是她的同伴，我們一直在找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？你叫什麼名字？可以請你……請你帶我們去見這位塞拉菲娜小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫……別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，跟我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡……發生了，火災。留下來的人，都在，村子外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐一直，幫我們。沒有她，我們，沒辦法，走到……這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，你們是從中心礦區來的礦工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。現在，你們來了，還說幫忙。太好了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，我們一定能，活下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，到了。就在前面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢揚叔叔？你還在，發燒，不要坐在……門口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒發燒，腿上爛掉的地方用衣服綁起來就不痛了，無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？你又帶誰來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們認識，塞拉菲娜姐姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我們和她的小隊來自同一家醫藥公司，請相信我們沒有惡意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚訝的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭……真的是你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是怎麼找到這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然真的是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，終於找到你們了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她衝上去，抱住失聯多日的同伴。\n阿米婭想過，也許不該在他人面前這樣直接地表露自己的情緒，但現在，她難以拒絕這個放下心防的時機。\n沒有什麼比得上久別重逢的喜悅，也沒有什麼比得上見到牽掛的人安然無恙時那一刻的安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩提到你的名字時，我還不敢確定，但現在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是最好的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian……你們怎麼樣？還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事……真抱歉，讓你們擔心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小隊全員共九人，現在歸隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你們能找到這裡……是有人發現了我沿路留下的痕跡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聰明的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra！我就知道你一定也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在發現你失聯後，我們和博士還有Mon3tr就一起趕來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他們現在正在等我們找到的那位研究員醒來，之後如果通訊能恢復，就會來和我們會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？博士也來烏薩斯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我們彼此應該都有很多問題想問……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……撲滅火災之後，雷爾金帶領另一部分的人離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在這裡的，是一些不願意，或者沒有能力繼續往前走的礦工，還有原本就住在這裡的村民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遺憾，沒能提前阻止……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然還發生了這種事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位雷爾金先生與整合運動有什麼關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……根據我瞭解的情況，他沒有直接與整合運動取得聯絡，他只是相信在烏卡邊境上有一處整合運動的據點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間裡我也曾聽遠北的某些流亡感染者說過類似的事情，羅德島有得到任何相關的資訊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，所以你的意思是，這群人與整合運動完全無關，只是抓住了一面旗幟就盲目揮舞了起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位新面孔是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤·戈爾奇科娃，近衛軍前鋒營中士。您可以叫我阿洛伊澤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛軍為什麼會出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位阿洛伊澤小姐幫助我們進入了礦區，她是為了調查中心礦區變異感染者的傳聞而來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小姐，很榮幸認識你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我由衷地為你們的重聚感到高興——但時間緊迫，請允許我開門見山地問了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否在這一群流亡的礦工中發現了變異感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變異感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為羅德島的幹員，你應該瞭解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……至少留在這裡的沒有。我的小隊在幫他們做檢查的時候，沒有發現所謂的變異感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就很奇怪了……這些人當中肯定有什麼不對勁的地方，如果留下的人沒有問題，那我們就要儘快追上離開的那些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們離開時有沒有告訴過你，他們打算從什麼路線去烏卡邊境？或者有沒有留下別的線索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我沒有義務向你報告什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小姐，請你相信，我來到這裡，唯一的目的就是查明變異感染者風波的真相，盡可能平息動亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖駿堡也是站在想要維護感染者利益的立場上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，尊敬的近衛軍小姐。這些話在我聽來絲毫沒有說服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“塔什干礦場”、“黑河監獄”等等……我從來沒有見過有哪一位貴族站出來維護“感染者的利益”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，竟然是第三集團軍的人嗎？……原來你也是一位烏薩斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前就已經不是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧……Raidian小姐，我相信你有充分的理由討厭這個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無論如何，我依然決心要為我的國家效忠。你想要避免的事情，在另一種意義上，我也希望能避免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那群離開這裡的礦工正在向南方前進，他們想去烏卡邊境的話，無論如何都會先路過聖駿堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他們是否意識到了這點，但只要被發現，不管他們的目的是什麼，都會被認作是一支膽敢向首都發動叛亂的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……到那時候，等待他們的結局不會有第二種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤小姐，我以為您只是詢問，而不是威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是陳述事實。如果這位朋友能夠如實相告，那我也不用這麼嚴肅。我需要知道這群礦工是怎麼離開的，他們逃跑的目的又是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到這個時候還要有所隱瞞的話，不論是對你還是對他們，都非常不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只看到一群想要努力活下去的感染者，沒有任何人可以站在任何立場指控他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，還是說服不了嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐，能否看在我們這一路同行的情分上，幫我勸說一下這位倔強的黎博利小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下，阿洛伊澤小姐。在此之前還有另一件更緊急的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在這裡的礦工和村民目前還處在非常危險的狀態。他們沒有物資，無處可去，我們不能放任他們不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要先確保他們的安全，才能談下一步打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村民不用你們考慮，我原本就打算事後幫他們尋求援助、重建村莊——女大公在這些事情上一向慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這些礦工，他們不是簡單說明就能解決的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您不願意，那羅德島會為他們提供幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為了我們的合作，我就再幫你們一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們帶礦工去聖駿堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，主動去聖駿堡，先一步將這些礦工變為證人，之後就立刻向陛下稟報中心礦區感染者異變的始末與真相……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣聖駿堡就有理由庇護他們，也有理由攔截而非“剿滅”那些已經離開的人。這些措施至少能實施到針對女大公的調查結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去遊說議長，請陛下赦免這些感染者，再以醫療協助的名義請羅德島介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……又或者，你現在只是需要這些礦工來當證人，等用他們扳倒女大公之後就不一定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則你們沒有任何放過這些感染者的理由。我瞭解烏薩斯，無論那位陛下想給這片冰冷的土地帶來怎樣的溫暖……它都不會屬於感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收回你的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我也只是“陳述事實”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——也許烏薩斯的確是這樣，但我願意相信阿洛伊澤小姐。我們一路以來的合作足以讓我得出這樣的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阿洛伊澤小姐。Raidian只是表達了她的擔憂，相信大家多少都瞭解烏薩斯對感染者問題的態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，即使這只是對我個人……我得說，感謝信任。"},{"type":"narration","text":"近衛軍動作誇張地向兩人鞠了一躬，最後略帶挑釁地看向了Raidian。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那我也還有最後一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有做這些事的權限嗎，“中士”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是你離開聖駿堡太久了，還沒有聽說過“戈爾奇科娃”這個姓氏在聖駿堡的分量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以自己的家族起誓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後面的事，除了提供醫療協助，其他都不需要你們擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你沒說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算這樣的方案可行，我們也需要先徵求礦工們的同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，讓我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會向他們說明情況，並詢問他們的想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克，你在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們得告訴大家，我們現在有一個選擇，離開這裡，所有人一起去聖駿堡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖駿堡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽說……聖駿堡，街上種著，洋槐，和櫻桃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空，是，亮的。羽獸會，築、築巢，不會，飛走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那裡有，春天。是，那個，聖駿堡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是那個聖駿堡。你想去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去！我想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！"},{"type":"narration","text":"她說得太急、太快，以至於喉嚨嗆入了冷氣，開始因乾燥而疼痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想，但其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒，離開，礦區。我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得問問其他人是不是也像你一樣，願意相信我們，願意去聖駿堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去，我去問。一定、一定願意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你……回來，之前，達雅說，我們走、走不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算想、想走，回礦區，外面的人，也會，來攔。他們要，把我們都……燒死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要，告訴她，不是、不是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，不是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達雅！達雅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達雅，我們一起，去，聖駿堡！姐姐有、有辦法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，都……都去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……達雅？"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩靠牆坐得筆直，卻沒有任何反應。她閉著眼，倦意和枯槁像陰影一樣爬滿她年輕的面頰。\n她仍在呼吸，卻只是在維持著最低限度的生存本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不能……留在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我——走——我扶著，你！我可以，扶著你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達雅……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許她只是太累了，讓她好好休息吧，我們先去找其他人——"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克環視四周，希望友人的沉默只是偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢揚叔叔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她走過去，依次搖晃每個人，卻發現不知從什麼時候開始，他們都已經僵硬地直起身來，就像達雅一樣。\n他們有的跪著，有的站著，卻無一例外都將身軀虔誠地朝向屋內深處那位頭顱低垂的老者，彷彿聽不見其他聲音。\n別喬克抬頭望去，一個稱呼下意識地從口中滑出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奶奶？"},{"type":"narration","text":"順著別喬克惶惑的眼神，Raidian也抬頭望去。\n在眾人視線的盡頭，蒼老的聲音環繞整個空間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾為烏薩斯銘記之人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"帽兜遮住了她的面容，也遮蔽了她的視線。但Raidian莫名覺得，那人的目光並非投向自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您在說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉打擾，但你這樣實在有點太慢囉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位！我現在有一個能儘量保障所有人安全的提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“中士”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是跟我們離開遠北，前往聖駿堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，帝國議會會為各位提供庇護，只要你們能站出來，作為證人指認女大公的罪行，配合針對她的調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝陛下需要知道這裡發生了什麼，烏薩斯需要知道這裡發生了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在一切塵埃落定之後，你們認識的這位女士，她所在的羅德島，一家醫藥公司，將會為你們提供後續的醫療幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，願意跟我離開的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們根本沒有聽見你說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人身上的電訊號……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有來源的森然冷意刺穿Raidian的大腦皮層，幾乎將她釘在原地。\n她突然不願繼續開口示警，即使這本來是她上一秒要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"再怎麼混亂的電訊號在她看來都很溫和，然而此刻她卻不得不將其變為使自己清醒的鋒利刀刃。\nRaidian調動源石技藝將自己的全身麻痺，以求掙脫那無形且莫名的束縛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你怎麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快——走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"馬上——帶所有人——離開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士，我感覺到寒冷和……痛苦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個漩渦，在邀請我踏入……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，不要去看，不要去聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，馬上用源石技藝暫時封鎖自己的感官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境，你也一樣。你們留在這裡，我去調查情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要進來！這裡的情況很奇怪，他們聽不到我們說話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它呼喚了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這就是我應該面對的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra閉眼，整個封閉空間開始以類似意識藍圖的形式在腦海中構築。\n她踏入屋內，她要找到錨定這裡每個活躍意識的點，喚醒他們，使他們“聽見”。\n至少，本應如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……只有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沉默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅。\n刺目的紅。\n和雪地中的熱血一樣的紅色，從視網膜四周攀緣而上。\n而後，她睜開眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是忍受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是虔信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是靈魂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是靈魂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我忍耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我相信！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我承受……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下在上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#FF4200>“聖愚在上！”</color>"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["極境"]}]}
